---
layout: layouts/base.njk
title: Blog
description: Notes on building a calm, private, and free health companion, in the open.
permalink: /blog/
---
<div class="blog-wrap">
  <h1>Blog</h1>
  <p class="blog-intro">Notes on building Health Flare in the open: why it is free software, why it stays offline, and why it exists at all.</p>

  {%- if collections.postTopics.length %}
  <div class="topic-nav">
    <p class="topic-nav-label">Browse by topic</p>
    <ul class="topic-list">
      {%- for topic in collections.postTopics %}
      <li><a class="topic-pill" href="/blog/tags/{{ topic | slugify }}/">{{ topic | topicLabel }}</a></li>
      {%- endfor %}
    </ul>
  </div>
  {%- endif %}

  <ul class="post-list">
    {%- for post in collections.posts %}
    <li class="post-card">
      <a href="{{ post.url }}">
        <p class="post-date">{{ post.data.date | readableDate }}</p>
        <h2>{{ post.data.title }}</h2>
        <p>{{ post.data.description }}</p>
      </a>
      {%- if post.data.tags | length %}
      <ul class="topic-list">
        {%- for topic in post.data.tags %}
        {%- if topic != "posts" %}
        <li><a class="topic-pill" href="/blog/tags/{{ topic | slugify }}/">{{ topic | topicLabel }}</a></li>
        {%- endif %}
        {%- endfor %}
      </ul>
      {%- endif %}
    </li>
    {%- endfor %}
  </ul>
</div>
